# With completed tasks hidden, Tab while editing a task indents it under the visible task above and the editor stays on screen.
# BUG: Tab nests the edited task under the hidden done task above it; the block being edited disappears while edit mode goes on, and typed text goes into the invisible block.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Bank @done(2026-10-01)
	- Post office
	- Pharmacy @done(2026-10-02)
	- Hardware store
END
keys gc G <Enter> <Tab>
see ▌     - Hardware store
type  XYZ
see ▌     - Hardware store XYZ
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Bank @done(2026-10-01)
	- Post office
		- Hardware store XYZ
	- Pharmacy @done(2026-10-02)
END
